  "body": "## ≡ƒöÉAdd Role-Based Access Control (RBAC) for Investigators\n\n### Is your feature request related to a problem? Please describe.\nCurrently, all authenticated users have similar access levels. In real forensic environments, different roles (Analyst, Lead Investigator, Admin) require different permissions.\n\n### Describe the solution you'd like\nImplement Role-Based Access Control:\n\n- Roles:\n  - Admin (full access to all cases + settings)\n  - Investigator (create + analyze cases)\n  - Viewer (read-only access)\n- Protect routes like `/dashboard`, `/cases`, `/reports`\n- Enforce role checks in both frontend and backend (FastAPI + NextAuth)\n\n### Describe alternatives you've considered\nSingle-role authentication, but it lacks real-world forensic workflow control.\n\n### Additional context\nImproves security, audit compliance, and realistic forensic simulation.\n\n≡ƒôî Kindly allot this issue to @Coder-010506",
